%% Source: paper/model/enums/OrderStatus.java, paper/entity/PaperOrder.java (inList, activate, reject, fill,
%% completeFill, cancel, expire), paper/service/impl/SpotArrival.java and PaperOrderLists.java. Spot demo only.
%% Since V47 the table is trade_order; the entity keeps the name PaperOrder.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW : place a Spot order (TR-02)
    [*] --> PENDING_NEW : pending leg of an OTO or OTOCO group (TR-10)
    PENDING_NEW --> NEW : working order of the group filled (TR-10, D-77)
    PENDING_NEW --> REJECTED : free balance too low when placed (INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE)
    PENDING_NEW --> CANCELED : group cancelled
    NEW --> PARTIALLY_FILLED : part executed
    NEW --> FILLED : executed in full, a MARKET order on arrival
    PARTIALLY_FILLED --> PARTIALLY_FILLED : another part executed
    PARTIALLY_FILLED --> FILLED : rest executed, or quote amount spent
    NEW --> CANCELED : cancel by the Trader, or pair stopped trading (PAIR_NOT_TRADING)
    PARTIALLY_FILLED --> CANCELED : cancel by the Trader, or pair stopped trading
    NEW --> EXPIRED : IOC or FOK not fillable, LIMIT_MAKER would take, OCO partner executed
    PARTIALLY_FILLED --> EXPIRED : rest not fillable under its time in force
    FILLED --> [*]
    CANCELED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
